LUMA SUMMARY:
Sir-Tech Chapter Three begins. Cozmo describes the enormous Apple II+ setup, direct access to in-house source/object code, the Wizardry editing tools, and the realization that he could inspect the actual tools behind the games he had been hacking. The session pauses after the first deep look at the editor/industry environment.
